WEBVTT

00:27.160 --> 00:30.560
♪Peach blossoms fall,
yesterday's trace fades away♪

00:30.800 --> 00:34.080
♪Ahead lie storms and winds,
our fates like drifting clouds sway♪

00:34.400 --> 00:40.040
♪Alas, I roam through what remains,
fate's grip won't set me free♪

00:41.400 --> 00:44.920
♪If time would spare me
just one breath to stay♪

00:45.520 --> 00:48.920
♪If you could see
the depth of my belief♪

00:49.120 --> 00:55.680
♪Alone I enter the game,
every move made with no regret in me♪

00:56.080 --> 01:00.040
♪Though shackles bind my soul
and chain my form♪

01:00.160 --> 01:03.240
♪I've walked
through life and death before♪

01:03.320 --> 01:10.200
♪I fear not fate's cruel temptations,
I've severed every cause♪

01:10.400 --> 01:14.440
♪In this life our threads entwined,
in love and pain we crossed♪

01:14.600 --> 01:17.480
♪But I'll keep my word
no matter the cost♪

01:17.560 --> 01:19.960
♪Forged in stardust and flame♪

01:20.040 --> 01:25.800
♪I rise with an unyielding frame♪

01:35.120 --> 01:36.960
=The Princess's Gambit=

01:37.040 --> 01:39.440
(Adapted from the novel "Peach Blossoms
Reflecting the River and Mountains")

01:39.520 --> 01:42.000
(by Bai Lu Cheng Shuang)

01:42.160 --> 01:44.920
=Episode 18=

01:45.040 --> 01:47.840
(Qinfang Tea House)

02:14.880 --> 02:15.640
Wait.

02:17.320 --> 02:17.920
What?

02:19.320 --> 02:20.200
Jiang Taohua,

02:21.000 --> 02:23.080
you keep making excuses
and refusing to act.

02:23.600 --> 02:24.200
Yet,

02:24.320 --> 02:26.600
you dare to stop me
when I take matters into my own hands?

02:27.160 --> 02:28.040
I dare not.

02:28.800 --> 02:31.160
There are too many eyes here.

02:31.480 --> 02:32.760
If you act here,

02:33.280 --> 02:35.880
Shen Zaiye will trace it back
to Lan Boutique.

02:36.720 --> 02:38.280
If Lan Boutique falls,

02:38.880 --> 02:40.160
all of Her Highness's years

02:40.360 --> 02:42.280
of careful planning in Qi

02:42.480 --> 02:43.560
will be ruined.

02:44.400 --> 02:46.120
It's hardly worth paying

02:46.440 --> 02:48.000
such a heavy price

02:48.400 --> 02:49.520
for one Prince Wuxia.

02:55.360 --> 02:56.160
I suppose

02:56.840 --> 02:57.720
you have another idea?

02:59.840 --> 03:01.120
That day in the Imperial Library,

03:01.760 --> 03:03.480
this incense was only lit for a moment

03:03.720 --> 03:05.280
before Shen Zaiye's appearance forced us

03:05.680 --> 03:06.680
to extinguish it.

03:07.520 --> 03:08.200
Why not

03:08.840 --> 03:10.320
continue to use it?

03:14.680 --> 03:15.960
As long as we light it,

03:16.440 --> 03:18.000
before a single stick burns out,

03:18.720 --> 03:19.600
Prince Wuxia

03:20.120 --> 03:21.320
will be dead.

03:25.480 --> 03:26.520
Rest assured.

03:26.800 --> 03:28.680
It was only lit for a moment.

03:29.200 --> 03:30.600
That will not affect its potency.

03:33.040 --> 03:34.120
It had better be that way.

03:36.520 --> 03:38.520
You always have your little tricks.

03:39.200 --> 03:41.080
I will stand outside the door myself

03:41.640 --> 03:43.240
until this incense finishes burning.

04:23.440 --> 04:25.240
Chancellor, Wang Xi just reported.

04:25.520 --> 04:27.080
Prince Wuxia went out of the residence

04:27.200 --> 04:28.440
at Princess Chengping's invitation

04:28.520 --> 04:29.560
and suddenly disappeared.

04:30.080 --> 04:31.720
It happened all too suddenly. He fears…

04:34.080 --> 04:35.080
Where's Princess Chengping?

04:35.160 --> 04:37.200
She also left the residence
and headed to a tea house.

04:37.280 --> 04:38.320
Yang Wanqing is there too.

04:39.680 --> 04:41.520
Chancellor, our people are ready.

04:41.600 --> 04:43.960
But Princess Chengping promised
she would not harm Prince Wuxia.

04:44.040 --> 04:45.520
We worried there was a misunderstanding,

04:45.600 --> 04:46.520
so we did not act rashly.

04:46.600 --> 04:48.040
Do you think it's a misunderstanding?

04:48.560 --> 04:49.720
We'll know once we get there.

05:03.080 --> 05:04.360
Enough time has passed.

05:05.040 --> 05:06.160
The poison in there is enough

05:06.600 --> 05:08.080
to kill Prince Wuxia.

05:08.880 --> 05:10.320
Now you can rest easy.

05:13.920 --> 05:15.840
You did not disappoint
Her Highness this time.

05:16.680 --> 05:17.280
Rest assured.

05:17.640 --> 05:20.280
I will report this to Her Highness
and recommend a reward for you.

05:21.480 --> 05:23.240
I failed last time.

05:23.520 --> 05:25.480
This is merely my atonement.

05:25.640 --> 05:26.680
I dare not expect a reward.

05:28.520 --> 05:29.800
Her Highness is always strict

05:30.040 --> 05:31.600
with rewards and punishments.

05:32.680 --> 05:34.440
If you do it right,
you should be rewarded.

05:35.000 --> 05:36.040
But if tomorrow

05:36.680 --> 05:39.200
I don't hear news of Mu Wuxia's death,

05:40.560 --> 05:42.200
then you must have played tricks again.

05:43.040 --> 05:44.520
I will report it to Her Highness.

05:45.760 --> 05:47.920
I assume you're perfectly aware
of what will happen

05:49.560 --> 05:50.800
to you and Prince Changjue then.

05:51.760 --> 05:52.680
Of course.

06:01.080 --> 06:01.680
Hup!

06:05.000 --> 06:05.600
Hup!

06:16.080 --> 06:16.680
Prince Wuxia!

06:19.880 --> 06:21.400
Prince Wuxia! Prince Wuxia!

06:21.680 --> 06:22.280
Wake up!

06:22.400 --> 06:23.000
Prince Wuxia!

06:28.920 --> 06:30.640
Add more flour, Your Highness.

06:30.720 --> 06:32.320
Otherwise the poison will be too strong.

06:32.760 --> 06:33.360
No.

06:33.560 --> 06:34.920
Yang Wanqing is cautious.

06:35.240 --> 06:35.840
She'll notice

06:35.920 --> 06:37.080
if there's too much flour.

06:37.840 --> 06:39.160
We must be clever

06:39.360 --> 06:40.920
if we want to fool her.

06:43.040 --> 06:44.360
Thank goodness, he's still alive.

07:00.360 --> 07:01.680
(Xie)

07:06.640 --> 07:09.120
(Why is the handkerchief
from Shen Zaiye's hidden compartment)

07:09.800 --> 07:11.040
(on Prince Wuxia?)

07:14.040 --> 07:14.840
My cousin

07:15.360 --> 07:16.520
was a genius.

07:17.200 --> 07:18.640
He's someone I spent my life chasing.

07:19.360 --> 07:20.800
Where he is now?

07:23.000 --> 07:23.920
He has long been gone.

07:24.920 --> 07:25.640
(Could it be)

07:26.520 --> 07:28.360
(that Shen Zaiye is the cousin)

07:29.480 --> 07:30.840
(Prince Wuxia keeps talking about?)

08:12.320 --> 08:12.920
Your Highness!

08:15.920 --> 08:16.680
Jiang Taohua.

08:17.280 --> 08:18.240
What are you doing?

08:18.800 --> 08:19.440
Saving a life.

08:23.400 --> 08:24.520
Your Highness! Your Highness!

08:26.920 --> 08:28.280
Chancellor, it's Soulsever Incense.

08:29.840 --> 08:31.200
Take Prince Wuxia back for treatment.

08:31.280 --> 08:31.880
Yes, sir.

08:33.600 --> 08:34.200
Here.

08:45.080 --> 08:46.120
When has Soulsever Incense

08:48.600 --> 08:50.120
ever been used to save anyone?

08:51.080 --> 08:52.160
If you already think

08:52.640 --> 08:53.440
I tried to kill him,

08:54.120 --> 08:55.640
why waste words?

09:00.080 --> 09:00.680
Take her away!

09:10.600 --> 09:11.200
Jiang Taohua,

09:11.600 --> 09:13.200
you said you wouldn't harm Prince Wuxia.

09:14.440 --> 09:15.480
Tell me who is behind this

09:16.440 --> 09:17.440
and what happened today,

09:18.040 --> 09:19.000
and I will let you go.

09:20.800 --> 09:22.120
I said I was saving him,

09:23.040 --> 09:24.880
and you threw me
into the interrogation room.

09:26.720 --> 09:28.280
Is this how you show trust?

09:29.520 --> 09:31.480
Soulsever Incense claims the soul
with a breath.

09:31.760 --> 09:33.280
Prince Wuxia lies unconscious.

09:33.760 --> 09:35.000
He has a knife wound on his neck.

09:35.080 --> 09:36.200
You stood nearby with a blade.

09:36.280 --> 09:37.800
Tell me how I am supposed to trust you.

09:37.880 --> 09:38.920
If that is how it is,

09:39.560 --> 09:41.240
even if I told you who was behind it,

09:41.800 --> 09:43.440
would you not think

09:44.000 --> 09:45.480
I was making it up

09:45.640 --> 09:46.640
to save myself?

09:50.400 --> 09:52.640
You overestimate yourself

09:53.840 --> 09:55.680
and underestimate me.

09:58.520 --> 09:59.680
I'll ask you one last time.

10:01.040 --> 10:01.920
Who is

10:03.000 --> 10:03.880
behind this?

10:05.360 --> 10:06.280
No one ordered me.

10:11.600 --> 10:12.440
Jiang Taohua.

10:13.160 --> 10:15.000
You should think carefully
before you answer.

10:15.800 --> 10:16.960
I have thought carefully.

10:18.600 --> 10:19.680
You and I will never

10:20.400 --> 10:22.600
truly trust each other in this life.

10:23.200 --> 10:24.120
So

10:25.080 --> 10:26.760
we might as well speak plainly.

10:29.320 --> 10:30.520
If you want to torture me,

10:31.000 --> 10:31.640
go ahead.

10:31.840 --> 10:33.120
You think I won't?

10:41.240 --> 10:42.000
Why?

10:43.320 --> 10:44.920
Why Prince Wuxia?

10:46.000 --> 10:47.360
You know how well he treated you.

10:47.640 --> 10:49.000
Is your heart made of stone?

10:49.400 --> 10:50.600
You should know by now.

10:51.360 --> 10:52.400
Someone like me

10:53.160 --> 10:54.200
will say anything

10:54.880 --> 10:56.240
to survive.

10:56.480 --> 10:57.640
I will kill anyone to live.

11:12.280 --> 11:14.560
How ruthless you are.

11:16.720 --> 11:17.920
I suppose if you die

11:18.480 --> 11:19.800
by my hand today,

11:21.560 --> 11:23.080
you will have no complaints.

11:26.240 --> 11:26.840
Of course.

11:29.600 --> 11:30.800
Throwing oneself into the fray

11:31.640 --> 11:32.560
and losing one's life

11:33.240 --> 11:34.360
is nothing unusual.

11:36.600 --> 11:37.760
Did you not

11:38.960 --> 11:40.440
also gamble your life

11:40.520 --> 11:41.600
at the hunting grounds?

11:49.160 --> 11:50.880
That arrow was suspicious.

11:51.720 --> 11:54.080
And the medicine to stop the bleeding
came so quickly.

11:54.800 --> 11:56.240
If you had not prepared in advance,

11:56.840 --> 11:58.320
how could it have arrived in time?

12:00.320 --> 12:02.520
Just because
I held a piece of porcelain to my chest,

12:06.640 --> 12:09.560
you thought I was sacrificing myself
to protect you.

12:10.240 --> 12:11.600
Shows how little

12:12.520 --> 12:14.760
you've been truly cared for
in your life.

12:18.760 --> 12:23.120
♪That peace you longed for♪

12:23.400 --> 12:28.800
♪I was the one who had to take it away♪

12:30.160 --> 12:34.160
♪You weren't falling,
no need to feel all the sorrow and joy♪

12:34.240 --> 12:35.480
I lost.

12:37.920 --> 12:38.920
I'm far less ruthless

12:41.880 --> 12:43.040
than you.

12:46.160 --> 12:50.320
♪We were both unwilling to give in♪

12:51.520 --> 12:52.680
♪Who ever pitied us♪

12:52.760 --> 12:57.400
♪In those long, cold, uncertain years?♪

12:58.680 --> 13:02.720
♪What I offer now feels like the guilt
of not loving well enough♪

13:02.800 --> 13:04.040
Find out who is behind her.

13:04.120 --> 13:08.680
♪Do you know love,
when left unspoken, quietly fades?♪

13:08.760 --> 13:12.880
♪Among a noisy crowd of strangers♪

13:15.880 --> 13:20.280
♪Thankfully, fate bent down just enough♪

13:20.440 --> 13:26.920
♪To gather the love we once left behind♪

13:28.040 --> 13:28.640
Chancellor.

13:28.720 --> 13:29.440
How is Prince Wuxia?

13:29.520 --> 13:31.640
The imperial physician says
he did not inhale much poison.

13:31.720 --> 13:32.720
He will wake in a few days.

13:32.800 --> 13:33.400
Exactly how many

13:33.480 --> 13:34.600
depends on His Highness's body.

13:34.680 --> 13:35.800
Spread the word that tomorrow

13:35.880 --> 13:37.960
Prince Wuxia will go to Yugui Mountain.

13:38.200 --> 13:40.000
You want to draw out the snake
from its hole?

13:40.680 --> 13:41.720
Better to end the threat now

13:41.800 --> 13:43.160
than to spend a lifetime on guard.

13:43.800 --> 13:45.760
Tomorrow, lead our men yourself
to lay the trap.

13:46.360 --> 13:46.960
Understood.

13:48.440 --> 13:49.080
Chancellor.

13:49.600 --> 13:50.360
She refused to speak.

13:50.440 --> 13:51.960
We had no choice but to use the whip.

13:59.880 --> 14:00.560
Cease this!

14:02.160 --> 14:03.280
- Chancellor.
- Chancellor.

14:24.760 --> 14:26.120
Take her back to Zhengchun Boudoir.

14:27.000 --> 14:28.120
I'll interrogate her myself.

14:39.400 --> 14:41.800
(Shen Residence)

14:50.520 --> 14:51.280
Your Highness!

14:54.800 --> 14:55.920
I'll get you some medicine.

14:56.480 --> 14:57.440
That won't be necessary.

14:58.320 --> 14:59.400
I've already treated myself.

15:07.240 --> 15:08.520
He did this to you.

15:08.880 --> 15:09.960
I'll kill him!

15:11.840 --> 15:12.680
Qingtai.

15:14.600 --> 15:15.680
If you lose,

15:16.760 --> 15:18.120
you should accept the consequences.

15:19.240 --> 15:20.920
Can't we please stop this?

15:22.560 --> 15:24.280
I don't want to see you get hurt again.

15:28.680 --> 15:30.440
Now's not the time for tears.

15:31.360 --> 15:33.120
We have more important things to do.

15:37.040 --> 15:38.120
How is Prince Wuxia?

15:40.040 --> 15:41.040
You did not come back,

15:41.160 --> 15:42.520
so I went to check on things.

15:43.360 --> 15:44.880
Prince Wuxia is fine.

15:45.320 --> 15:47.760
Tomorrow, he will go to Yugui Mountain.

15:49.000 --> 15:49.600
Impossible.

15:50.880 --> 15:52.640
Even though I switched the incense,

15:53.320 --> 15:55.400
he should be sleeping
for at least a day and a night.

15:58.600 --> 16:00.600
Shen Zaiye must have
spread false information

16:01.320 --> 16:02.640
to lure us out.

16:04.280 --> 16:05.600
This could be an opportunity.

16:07.520 --> 16:08.720
I'll use his trick against him.

16:11.040 --> 16:12.560
I must see Yang Wanqing at once.

16:13.520 --> 16:14.920
But if he learns

16:15.000 --> 16:16.680
we went to Yang Wanqing,

16:17.360 --> 16:18.440
he might…

16:20.640 --> 16:21.600
There is no future

16:23.600 --> 16:25.160
to speak of between him and me.

16:28.760 --> 16:29.960
Yugui Mountain's winding paths

16:30.080 --> 16:31.160
are perfect for an ambush.

16:31.760 --> 16:33.200
They won't let this chance slip away.

16:33.720 --> 16:34.720
Rest assured, Chancellor.

16:34.920 --> 16:36.160
Our men are already in position.

16:39.080 --> 16:39.720
Chancellor.

16:40.120 --> 16:42.320
Zhengchun Boudoir sent a letter.

16:49.280 --> 16:49.960
Chancellor.

16:57.720 --> 17:01.120
(A Letter of Parting)

17:01.240 --> 17:04.599
(From Jiang Taohua)

17:08.240 --> 17:10.560
Chancellor,
the operation is about to begin.

17:10.640 --> 17:12.319
We should avoid
unnecessary complications.

17:13.040 --> 17:14.280
I want to see

17:14.960 --> 17:16.280
what she is up to.

17:29.800 --> 17:31.320
This lip rouge contains a sedative.

17:31.520 --> 17:32.920
Your Highness must use it with care.

17:38.440 --> 17:40.360
I've already been poisoned
by the Jiangtao pill.

17:41.440 --> 17:42.840
This won't affect me.

17:49.600 --> 17:50.720
Go and make the preparations.

17:50.920 --> 17:52.000
He should be arriving soon.

18:10.200 --> 18:11.000
Jiang Taohua.

18:13.680 --> 18:15.400
Is this what you wanted to tell me?

18:55.480 --> 18:56.520
Things have come to this.

18:57.600 --> 18:59.000
If we keep going,

18:59.680 --> 19:01.200
we will only grow to resent each other.

19:02.760 --> 19:04.040
Better to part ways

19:04.680 --> 19:06.520
and each seek happiness.

19:08.960 --> 19:10.480
I invited you tonight

19:11.920 --> 19:14.280
for a final farewell drink.

19:20.880 --> 19:22.000
Finish this cup

19:22.920 --> 19:24.160
and we are done.

19:38.320 --> 19:40.240
Your true identity is unknown.

19:41.680 --> 19:44.240
You tried to harm a prince of Qi

19:45.360 --> 19:47.200
and threaten the state of Qi.

19:48.160 --> 19:50.040
Your list of crimes
is too numerous to list.

19:51.960 --> 19:53.320
Do you think you can just walk away

19:54.360 --> 19:55.480
with a simple divorce?

19:56.880 --> 19:57.760
Never!

19:58.680 --> 20:00.560
It's because I'm already disgraced

20:02.520 --> 20:03.840
that I want a divorce

20:06.200 --> 20:07.480
to keep you safe.

20:11.720 --> 20:13.480
You think you're doing this
to protect me?

20:33.160 --> 20:34.880
Do you remember when we first met?

20:38.080 --> 20:38.960
From that moment,

20:39.720 --> 20:41.160
our fate was sealed.

20:42.560 --> 20:43.440
Never close,

20:44.040 --> 20:45.000
yet never free.

20:46.400 --> 20:47.680
I forced

20:48.240 --> 20:49.560
this marriage upon you.

20:51.960 --> 20:52.920
Ending it now

20:54.040 --> 20:55.360
is following the will of Heaven.

20:59.280 --> 21:00.200
Do you regret

21:03.520 --> 21:04.560
marrying me?

21:11.800 --> 21:13.000
I may have lost the game,

21:15.320 --> 21:16.520
but I do not regret my moves.

21:20.280 --> 21:21.520
Do you remember our days

21:23.080 --> 21:24.640
in Tianshui Village?

21:26.680 --> 21:28.320
They were short,

21:30.440 --> 21:31.880
but they were the happiest days

21:32.520 --> 21:33.720
of my life.

21:34.800 --> 21:35.720
If I could,

21:36.760 --> 21:38.240
I'd leave it all behind

21:38.800 --> 21:40.240
for a quiet life.

21:41.920 --> 21:44.520
Farming, weaving,

21:46.240 --> 21:47.520
raising chickens and ducks.

21:52.640 --> 21:53.680
A simple,

21:54.840 --> 21:55.800
peaceful life

21:57.000 --> 21:57.800
would be blissful.

22:13.640 --> 22:16.160
But you've turned my life upside down.

22:18.680 --> 22:20.240
Now you want to leave

22:21.440 --> 22:23.280
and find peace

22:23.360 --> 22:24.520
somewhere else?

22:30.440 --> 22:31.800
Remember this, Jiang Taohua.

22:34.640 --> 22:38.520
I'm not someone you can just call on
and cast aside.

22:40.080 --> 22:41.320
This marriage

22:42.160 --> 22:43.840
was your choice.

22:45.040 --> 22:46.560
Even if it leads nowhere,

22:47.440 --> 22:49.600
you have to see it through with me.

22:52.520 --> 22:54.800
Living day in and day out
with someone you don't trust

22:56.480 --> 22:57.800
only brings misery and suffering.

23:00.360 --> 23:01.640
Haven't you already learned that

23:02.560 --> 23:04.000
with Ms. Meng?

23:04.320 --> 23:07.480
♪The flower bloomed,
knowing nothing at all♪

23:07.560 --> 23:10.720
♪In splendor, proud and tall♪

23:11.480 --> 23:14.680
♪The flower fell, lashed by the wind♪

23:14.800 --> 23:18.520
♪In a daze,
it felt like lifetimes had thinned♪

23:18.840 --> 23:21.840
♪Petals soaked in rain♪

23:21.920 --> 23:25.320
♪Heartbreak follows again and again♪

23:25.640 --> 23:29.240
♪The flower weeps, burdened by thoughts♪

23:29.320 --> 23:34.400
♪With no one it can be brought♪

23:40.000 --> 23:46.800
♪Wishes struggle through the mire♪

23:47.360 --> 23:53.920
♪Regrets clash in hopeless fire♪

23:54.160 --> 23:55.400
Drink this farewell wine.

23:56.480 --> 23:58.080
After tonight,

23:59.120 --> 24:00.440
we will never meet again.

24:02.000 --> 24:09.000
♪Even if it means this flower
will be hers to give to someone new♪

24:17.680 --> 24:19.360
I refuse

24:20.320 --> 24:21.560
to allow it.

24:23.680 --> 24:30.480
♪Wishes struggle through the mire♪

24:31.080 --> 24:37.680
♪Regrets clash in hopeless fire♪

24:38.280 --> 24:45.280
♪Still I hope
she'll pick the flower kissed by dew♪

24:45.680 --> 24:52.680
♪Even if it means this flower
will be hers to give to someone new♪

24:53.120 --> 24:59.640
♪Yet I still long for her in madness♪

25:00.120 --> 25:07.080
♪Unafraid of judgment or sadness♪

25:07.320 --> 25:14.320
♪Remembering the words
she spoke of flowers and skies♪

25:14.760 --> 25:21.760
♪And finding
they were her gentle heart's reply♪

25:29.440 --> 25:31.680
(Zhengchun Boudoir)

26:40.040 --> 26:40.720
Zhan Lu.

26:43.160 --> 26:43.760
Chancellor.

26:45.880 --> 26:46.680
Your token…

26:46.760 --> 26:47.600
Don't worry about it.

26:49.120 --> 26:50.200
Proceed with the plan.

26:51.640 --> 26:53.240
Anyone who tries to harm Prince Wuxia

26:53.680 --> 26:55.000
will be dealt with without mercy.

26:55.800 --> 26:58.880
What if Princess Chengping
is among those going up the mountain?

26:59.280 --> 27:00.160
Only those who intend

27:01.440 --> 27:03.720
to harm Prince Wuxia will be there.

27:04.800 --> 27:05.400
Understood.

27:13.560 --> 27:16.760
(Lan Boutique)

27:25.840 --> 27:27.360
You are bold,

27:27.800 --> 27:28.960
showing up here.

27:30.560 --> 27:31.280
Qing.

27:31.960 --> 27:33.160
Let's talk inside.

27:33.400 --> 27:34.400
Walls have ears.

27:46.600 --> 27:47.520
Mercy!

27:48.480 --> 27:50.560
Yesterday,
it was Shen Zaiye's sudden arrival

27:50.800 --> 27:52.160
that saved Mu Wuxia's life.

27:52.680 --> 27:54.360
You are exceptionally sharp

27:54.480 --> 27:55.640
and resourceful.

27:56.080 --> 27:57.440
I must admit I'm no match for you.

27:58.040 --> 28:00.480
But even fools have their ways.

28:00.800 --> 28:02.680
I'll let the results speak
for themselves.

28:04.000 --> 28:06.240
No matter how harshly

28:06.320 --> 28:07.360
I was tortured yesterday,

28:08.480 --> 28:10.680
I never uttered a single word.

28:11.360 --> 28:12.640
I snuck out and came here

28:13.040 --> 28:14.920
as soon as I could.

28:15.400 --> 28:17.240
I just want to redeem myself.

28:18.200 --> 28:19.200
My brother's and my life

28:20.040 --> 28:21.920
are both in Her Highness's hands.

28:22.720 --> 28:24.080
I dare not betray her.

28:24.440 --> 28:27.160
Mu Wuxia will be going
to Yugui Mountain today.

28:27.800 --> 28:30.600
I request your aid.

28:51.040 --> 28:52.440
(Can this situation be resolved)

28:53.320 --> 28:55.000
(if Prince Wuyin is made
to know that I,)

28:55.360 --> 28:56.200
(not Prince Wuxia,)

28:56.840 --> 28:57.520
(was the one)

28:58.160 --> 28:59.600
(who caught him in the act that day?)

29:05.920 --> 29:06.840
There is one more thing

29:07.440 --> 29:08.920
I must confess.

29:13.000 --> 29:14.280
I know

29:15.000 --> 29:16.320
who killed Eunuch Ren.

29:24.200 --> 29:25.080
Nonsense.

29:26.760 --> 29:28.600
I stumbled upon it by accident.

29:29.240 --> 29:30.280
I was so scared

29:30.400 --> 29:31.600
I did not dare admit it.

29:32.440 --> 29:34.080
Then I received the order

29:34.160 --> 29:35.560
to assassinate Mu Wuxia.

29:36.680 --> 29:37.880
I assumed

29:38.520 --> 29:40.200
it is related to Eunuch Ren's death.

29:40.560 --> 29:41.880
I have thought on this for days.

29:43.160 --> 29:44.400
Who Her Highness trusts,

29:44.920 --> 29:46.680
I should be loyal to as well.

29:47.440 --> 29:49.080
I'm willing to devote everything to him.

29:53.680 --> 29:54.280
I did not

29:54.920 --> 29:56.120
intend to disobey.

29:56.880 --> 29:58.320
Please relay my intentions.

29:59.120 --> 30:00.240
Plotting against a prince

30:00.320 --> 30:01.320
is no small matter.

30:01.760 --> 30:02.880
Perhaps it is best to wait

30:03.160 --> 30:04.120
and act cautiously.

30:08.720 --> 30:10.400
Do what you're supposed to do,

30:11.560 --> 30:13.040
and watch your tongue.

30:15.000 --> 30:15.800
Princess Chengping.

30:18.000 --> 30:20.320
I know you and Mu Wuxia
are close as siblings,

30:21.280 --> 30:23.280
but Mu Wuxia must die.

30:24.360 --> 30:24.960
Otherwise,

30:26.440 --> 30:28.160
it will be Prince Changjue who dies.

30:37.920 --> 30:38.760
I understand.

30:54.240 --> 30:55.320
Forgive me, Your Highness.

30:55.880 --> 30:56.880
I was remiss in my duties.

30:56.960 --> 30:58.440
I shouldn't have trusted her that day.

30:59.880 --> 31:00.720
But if

31:01.640 --> 31:03.840
what Jiang Taohua said just now is true,

31:05.200 --> 31:06.480
should we still kill Mu Wuxia?

31:07.640 --> 31:08.920
If chaos erupts,

31:09.680 --> 31:11.720
will it ruin Her Highness's plans?

31:15.480 --> 31:16.640
Prince Wugou has been deposed.

31:18.440 --> 31:19.840
Only us three remain.

31:21.040 --> 31:22.800
Prince Wuhen has
the Qin family behind him.

31:24.800 --> 31:26.440
We can't touch him for now.

31:27.400 --> 31:29.480
I always thought my fourth brother
kept a low profile

31:30.800 --> 31:32.760
and went unnoticed by everyone.

31:35.880 --> 31:37.680
To think he was so close with Shen Zaiye

31:37.760 --> 31:38.600
all along.

31:41.560 --> 31:42.600
If that's the case,

31:43.600 --> 31:45.160
whether what Jiang Taohua said

31:46.280 --> 31:48.560
is true or false

31:49.640 --> 31:51.200
no longer matters.

31:53.960 --> 31:55.120
What matters is that

31:57.520 --> 31:58.480
my fourth brother

32:02.440 --> 32:03.560
must die.

32:08.040 --> 32:11.880
(Langhua Residence)

32:17.400 --> 32:19.080
Your Highness, you're awake!

32:24.840 --> 32:25.840
What happened to me?

32:26.080 --> 32:27.440
It's all Jiang Taohua's fault!

32:27.920 --> 32:28.800
That ungrateful woman

32:29.000 --> 32:30.000
tried to kill you.

32:30.320 --> 32:31.280
She poisoned you

32:31.640 --> 32:32.720
with the Soulsever Incense.

32:33.840 --> 32:34.880
We were wrong about her.

32:36.640 --> 32:38.400
Thankfully,
Chancellor Shen arrived in time

32:39.120 --> 32:39.840
and saved you.

32:43.960 --> 32:44.560
I'll help you.

32:45.280 --> 32:45.880
Slowly.

32:48.720 --> 32:50.560
Your Highness, save your words.

32:50.680 --> 32:52.480
Don't damage your throat further.

32:52.680 --> 32:53.400
Please rest.

32:53.560 --> 32:54.960
I'll fetch the imperial physician.

33:01.360 --> 33:03.160
Prince Wuxia, wake up!

33:03.320 --> 33:04.000
Prince Wuxia!

33:05.440 --> 33:06.120
He's still alive.

33:08.960 --> 33:09.560
I remember

33:09.640 --> 33:10.520
Jiang Taohua…

33:11.080 --> 33:12.040
What are you doing?

33:12.880 --> 33:13.480
Saving a life.

33:17.240 --> 33:18.440
I have to find Chancellor Shen.

33:20.840 --> 33:21.520
Your Highness.

33:21.640 --> 33:22.520
Fresh flowers

33:22.600 --> 33:23.600
for sale.

33:24.400 --> 33:25.040
Have a look.

33:25.640 --> 33:26.400
Fresh flowers.

33:27.360 --> 33:28.160
Please have a look.

33:30.120 --> 33:31.400
Fresh flowers for sale!

33:32.440 --> 33:33.680
Have a look at my flowers, Miss.

33:34.600 --> 33:35.320
They're nice.

33:35.640 --> 33:36.720
If you like them, buy one.

33:36.960 --> 33:37.560
All right.

33:38.280 --> 33:39.360
Here you go. Take care.

34:32.239 --> 34:32.840
Go!

34:36.800 --> 34:37.400
Go!

34:40.480 --> 34:41.080
Go!

34:47.199 --> 34:48.000
Qing.

34:56.080 --> 34:57.120
Worry not.

34:58.040 --> 35:00.040
I will not gamble with my life.

35:00.520 --> 35:02.080
There will be no mistakes this time.

35:05.720 --> 35:06.480
Look.

35:09.120 --> 35:11.320
Yugui Mountain's cliffs are steep.

35:11.960 --> 35:13.840
The summit is towering and dangerous.

35:15.440 --> 35:17.440
Beside here is a bottomless abyss.

35:17.960 --> 35:18.560
Below,

35:18.960 --> 35:20.160
the river is fast and fierce.

35:21.880 --> 35:23.040
If something falls from there,

35:23.400 --> 35:25.200
even the strongest stone

35:25.560 --> 35:27.040
will shatter to pieces.

35:28.040 --> 35:29.680
If Mu Wuxia falls,

35:29.920 --> 35:30.880
even if he lives,

35:31.360 --> 35:32.920
he will be battered to bits

35:33.160 --> 35:34.480
by the jagged rocks.

35:35.320 --> 35:37.040
I trust I don't need to explain

35:37.680 --> 35:39.600
the gravity of today's plan to you.

35:40.200 --> 35:41.320
I understand

35:41.680 --> 35:42.680
the stakes.

35:43.240 --> 35:44.720
If anything goes wrong,

35:45.080 --> 35:47.480
please step in.

35:49.800 --> 35:51.360
That goes without saying.

35:51.440 --> 35:52.760
We share the same goal, after all.

36:08.600 --> 36:11.120
Shen Zaiye wants to pretend
to be Prince Wuxia to lure them out.

36:11.720 --> 36:12.920
We will use that

36:13.600 --> 36:14.920
to draw out Yang Wanqing

36:15.240 --> 36:16.080
and kill her.

36:17.320 --> 36:19.040
That will save Prince Wuxia's life
for now.

36:19.720 --> 36:20.680
If Empress Lv asks,

36:21.200 --> 36:22.120
we can blame everything

36:22.200 --> 36:23.760
on Shen Zaiye.

36:28.520 --> 36:29.520
There is a dangerous path

36:29.800 --> 36:30.840
on the mountain.

36:31.240 --> 36:32.280
I will act there.

36:33.400 --> 36:34.960
While I go find Yang Wanqing,

36:35.400 --> 36:36.920
you modify the carriage

36:37.440 --> 36:39.720
and hide nearby.

36:40.400 --> 36:41.240
If I succeed,

36:41.320 --> 36:42.280
I will send a signal.

36:42.400 --> 36:43.320
When you see it,

36:43.480 --> 36:44.560
join me immediately.

36:45.120 --> 36:47.360
Otherwise, the driver might turn on me.

36:48.520 --> 36:49.120
Your Highness,

36:49.560 --> 36:50.800
can I not stay in the carriage

36:50.880 --> 36:52.200
with you?

36:53.680 --> 36:55.240
Yang Wanqing doesn't trust me.

36:55.480 --> 36:56.360
She won't come with me

36:56.960 --> 36:58.000
if she sees you.

37:03.040 --> 37:03.640
Qing.

37:04.440 --> 37:06.040
We must hurry.

37:06.640 --> 37:08.960
Mu Wuxia is probably already
at the summit.

37:14.040 --> 37:15.040
Speed up the carriage.

37:15.720 --> 37:16.320
Yes.

37:16.440 --> 37:17.040
Go!

37:19.000 --> 37:19.600
Go!

37:23.840 --> 37:24.440
Go!

37:29.680 --> 37:30.280
Go!

38:16.160 --> 38:17.040
I never thought

38:17.840 --> 38:19.360
you would actually dare attack me

38:19.960 --> 38:21.640
for Mu Wuxia's sake.

38:23.360 --> 38:25.320
If Prince Wuyin had not been cautious,

38:25.840 --> 38:27.560
you would have gotten me today.

38:27.720 --> 38:29.000
Don't fool yourself into believing

38:29.080 --> 38:30.880
you're the smartest person in the world,

38:31.360 --> 38:32.840
and that everyone else is just a puppet

38:32.920 --> 38:34.360
you control.

38:35.520 --> 38:37.600
As cunning as Shen Zaiye is,

38:38.560 --> 38:41.400
would he really let Mu Wuxia out

38:42.720 --> 38:44.800
after learning he was nearly killed
at the tea house?

38:45.800 --> 38:47.920
You even came to me about it.

38:48.360 --> 38:49.760
That only made it more suspicious.

39:01.480 --> 39:02.400
Easy!

39:14.920 --> 39:15.840
Prince Wuxia?

39:17.760 --> 39:18.400
Prince Wuxia!

39:20.000 --> 39:20.920
What did you do to him?

39:25.040 --> 39:26.120
What is he doing here?

39:27.840 --> 39:29.480
If you can lure
the snake out of its hole,

39:29.560 --> 39:32.040
why can't I just wait patiently
for the rabbit to come to me?

39:33.760 --> 39:34.760
The foolish boy

39:34.840 --> 39:36.760
was still recovering,

39:36.920 --> 39:39.320
yet he was so eager to clear your name.

39:39.400 --> 39:41.480
We grabbed him
as soon as he left his residence.

39:43.600 --> 39:45.640
And your maid, Qingtai.

39:46.720 --> 39:48.960
She's quite skilled
in Beiyuan's secret mechanisms.

39:50.280 --> 39:52.000
So I had someone make a copy.

39:52.920 --> 39:54.360
"Beiyuan spy Jiang Taohua

39:54.440 --> 39:55.920
tried to harm a prince of Qi,

39:56.520 --> 39:58.400
caught by Qi's Left Chancellor
Shen Zaiye

39:58.840 --> 39:59.880
and executed on the spot."

40:01.840 --> 40:03.600
A story with no mention of Lan Boutique.

40:03.880 --> 40:04.960
Clean and perfect.

40:06.880 --> 40:07.560
Don't you think?

40:15.120 --> 40:15.880
Princess Chengping!

40:16.200 --> 40:17.440
Her Highness was framed!

40:17.800 --> 40:19.280
She didn't try to kill Prince Wuxia!

40:20.080 --> 40:20.760
Unhand me!

40:24.440 --> 40:25.440
If she were innocent,

40:26.400 --> 40:27.960
she would not be here.

40:33.320 --> 40:35.160
Let me go! Release me!

40:35.800 --> 40:37.720
Your Highness! Your Highness!

40:38.480 --> 40:40.800
Your Highness! Your Highness!

41:03.960 --> 41:04.640
Prince Wuxia?

41:06.480 --> 41:08.200
Your Highness! Your Highness!

41:09.520 --> 41:10.560
Your Highness!

41:10.840 --> 41:12.000
Your Highness! Watch out!

41:16.120 --> 41:17.360
Neither of you

41:18.320 --> 41:19.480
is leaving alive!

41:50.560 --> 41:53.760
♪The flower bloomed,
knowing nothing at all♪

41:53.840 --> 41:56.880
♪In splendor, proud and tall♪

41:57.800 --> 42:00.920
♪The flower fell, lashed by the wind♪

42:01.040 --> 42:04.800
♪In a daze,
it felt like lifetimes had thinned♪

42:05.080 --> 42:08.160
♪Petals soaked in rain♪

42:08.280 --> 42:11.600
♪Heartbreak follows again and again♪

42:12.000 --> 42:15.560
♪The flower weeps, burdened by thoughts♪

42:15.640 --> 42:21.360
♪With no one it can be brought♪

42:26.320 --> 42:33.240
♪Wishes struggle through the mire♪

42:33.680 --> 42:40.520
♪Regrets clash in hopeless fire♪

42:41.000 --> 42:48.000
♪Still I hope she'll pick the flower
kissed by dew♪

42:48.320 --> 42:52.360
♪Even if it means this flower♪

42:52.480 --> 42:59.440
♪Will be hers to give to someone new♪

43:10.560 --> 43:13.680
♪Whose eyes
did the flower's heart meet?♪

43:13.760 --> 43:17.000
♪Love and hate held back, discreet♪

43:17.360 --> 43:21.040
♪The flower withers, feelings in decay♪

43:21.160 --> 43:27.720
♪No longer needing to say♪

43:31.800 --> 43:38.720
♪Yet I still long for her in madness♪

43:39.120 --> 43:46.080
♪Unafraid of judgment or sadness♪

43:46.440 --> 43:53.440
♪Remembering the words
she spoke of flowers and skies♪

43:53.800 --> 43:55.480
♪And finding♪

43:55.560 --> 44:02.560
♪They were her gentle heart's reply♪
